From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anonymous <anonymous@localhost>
Date: Fri, 02 Oct 2026 17:54:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/20] Add settings for per-tracker announce limits

Exposes the tracker settings of the libtorrent tracker pool patch
(tracker_http_pool, tracker_http2, tracker_host_max_concurrency,
tracker_host_max_streams, tracker_stopped_concurrency,
tracker_failure_threshold, tracker_connect_timeout, tracker_queue_timeout,
tracker_host_max_queue) as Session settings,
WebAPI preferences and WebUI Advanced options.
---
 src/base/bittorrent/session.h                |  18 +++
 src/base/bittorrent/sessionimpl.cpp          | 154 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/base/bittorrent/sessionimpl.h            |  27 ++++
 src/webui/api/appcontroller.cpp              |  27 ++++
 src/webui/www/private/views/preferences.html |  90 +++++++++++
 5 files changed, 316 insertions(+)

